  data: {
    LLM: 'Turn Structure: 1. Draw: Draw 2 cards from stock OR pick up entire discard pile (if you can immediately use the top card in a meld). 2. Meld: Lay down melds or add to existing partnership melds. 3. Discard: Discard 1 card to end turn. Minimum Initial Meld: Round 1: 50 points, Round 2: 90 points, Round 3: 120 points, Round 4: 150 points. Picking Up Your Foot: After playing all cards from your hand, pick up your foot. If you discard your last hand card, pick up foot on next turn. If you play all hand cards without discarding, immediately pick up foot and continue playing.',
    Player: 'Turn Structure: 1. Draw: Draw 2 cards from stock OR pick up entire discard pile (if you can immediately use the top card in a meld). 2. Meld: Lay down melds or add to existing partnership melds. 3. Discard: Discard 1 card to end turn. Minimum Initial Meld: Round 1: 50 points, Round 2: 90 points, Round 3: 120 points, Round 4: 150 points. Picking Up Your Foot: After playing all cards from your hand, pick up your foot. If you discard your last hand card, pick up foot on next turn. If you play all hand cards without discarding, immediately pick up foot and continue playing.',
    objective: 'Score the most points over 4 rounds by forming melds and canastas. Be the first partnership to go out (empty hand and foot).',
    gameplay: 'Turn Structure: 1. Draw: Draw 2 cards from stock OR pick up entire discard pile (if you can immediately use the top card in a meld). 2. Meld: Lay down melds or add to existing partnership melds. 3. Discard: Discard 1 card to end turn. Minimum Initial Meld: Round 1: 50 points, Round 2: 90 points, Round 3: 120 points, Round 4: 150 points. Picking Up Your Foot: After playing all cards from your hand, pick up your foot. If you discard your last hand card, pick up foot on next turn. If you play all hand cards without discarding, immediately pick up foot and continue playing.',
    keyRules: [
      'Must follow suit if possible; if not, may play any card.',
      'Red Threes: +100 points if melded, -100 if caught in hand/foot.',
      'Black Threes: Cannot be melded; -5 points if caught in hand/foot.',
      'Clean Canasta (7 natural cards): +500 points.',
      'Dirty Canasta (with wilds): +300 points.',
      'To go out: Need at least 1 clean and 1 dirty canasta; both partners must have picked up their feet.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
    useTrump: false,
    trumpBonusValues: null,
