      equipment: 'Two denominations of chips or counters for scoring.',
      dealing: 'Each player receives TWO sets of cards: Hand (11-15 cards) and Foot (11-15 cards face-down). Remaining cards form the stock. Top card turned face-up to start discard pile (if Red Three or Wild, bury it and turn another).',
